=2 Walkthrough
* Speak to {n:Chemioue} on the top floor at (J-6) for a cutscene. Slightly north from HP #3.
* Speak to {n:Tressia}, next to {n:Chemioue}.
* Speak to {n:Parelbriaux} (K-7).
** Walk back to the HP, then continue up the ramp to the east.
** If you get a cutscene about a Shikaree tracker, that's for {q:Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker|Tango with a Tracker} - go talk to {n:Despachiaire} at (K-10) behind a Walnut Door, then return to Parelbriaux and talk to him twice more for a cutscene with Chemioue.
* Speak to {n:Ondieulix} (I-7), middle floor, for a cutscene. (Slightly south from HP #1.) This will formally add the quest to your Quests menu.
* Head to {z:Lufaise Meadows} and look for a **???** at (G-6).
* The **???** will spawn the NM {m:Baumesel} but only during foggy weather.
** Fog rolls into {z:Lufaise Meadows} most often during the early morning hours.
* Once the NM is defeated, check the **???** again and return to {n:Ondieulix} for your reward.

